From 43f12167652e3ead126f212f030b78005fe286c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: faycal <faycalelhandi9@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:14:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/26] perf(agc): resident staging switch, program-filtered
 dispatch trace, block-collect switch

- APS5_RESIDENT_STAGING=1 (off by default): skip copy-in of device-local regions whose host
  content is unchanged since the last copy-back. World map: 102.9 vs 101.2 presents per 10 s,
  GPU 63.8 vs 68.1 ms per frame. Adds residentKept counters to the [buffers] line.
- APS5_TRACE_PROGRAM=<hex>[:n]: limit APS5_TRACE_DISPATCH_IO and the dispatch header trace to
  every n-th dispatch of one guest program.
- APS5_WINDOWS_BLOCK_COLLECT: block-granular GetWriteWatch collect (off by default, no gain).
- docs: ENVIRONMENT.md row for APS5_TRACE_PROGRAM.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
